     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Folks,<div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\">Since a new quarter is upon us, we wanted to send something out about our listserv. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\">The Davis R-Users Group (D-RUG) listserv is an awesome environment to pose and answer questions that generally relate to &quot;R&quot; things. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">We currently have over a 1,000 members on the listserv, and more join each year. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">So, we (the D-RUG coordinators and community) want to send a friendly reminder on best practices for using this listserv. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">We&#39;ll send this email out once or twice a year, just to refresh everyone, and bring new folks up to speed.</span></div><div><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:1.75em;padding-bottom:0.3em;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\"><strong><em>R</em></strong> You Stuck with a Question?</h2><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">We all get stuck. No matter what your experience/background is, from beginner to expert. So when you get stuck, there are a few options. Before immediately turning to the listserv, try a few of these other options if you can. Sometimes this due diligence will answer your question. Sometimes it won&#39;t.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Here are a few options that can help:</strong></p><ol style=\"padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">You can google a term or problem and see if you can solve your problem, preface your search with <code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(240,240,240);border-radius:3px;padding:0.2em 0px;font-size:0.85em\">[R]</code> to narrow the search.<ul style=\"padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">Great option, used all the time, but hard if you don&#39;t know right terms/questions to google</li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">You can see if there&#39;s anything useful in the HELP section of RStudio/R (depends on the package and the function...some are well documented others are not)<ul style=\"padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">Try typing &quot;?&quot; + whatever term or function you are trying to use in the console, like: <code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(240,240,240);border-radius:3px;padding:0.2em 0px;font-size:0.85em\">?mean</code></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">Use 2 question marks to look for any function that has the term &quot;mean&quot; in it: <code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(240,240,240);border-radius:3px;padding:0.2em 0px;font-size:0.85em\">??mean</code></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">You can turn to the D-RUG listserv or workgroup meetings!</li></ol><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:1.75em;padding-bottom:0.3em;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\">Help Us Help You (<strong>REPR</strong>oducible <strong>EX</strong>amples)</h2><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">Learning R (or any coding language) can sometimes just be about persistence, due diligence, and repetition. What we as a community want to strive for is making our listserv and work sessions accessible to everyone, and make sure everyone has the opportunity to ask and answer questions. As part of this, if folks asking questions can spend a little extra time trying to build a reproducible example (REPREX), it helps because:</p><ul style=\"padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">More folks are willing to respond to the question because the questioner has spent time making it easier to answer</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">Questions with REPREX often get a quicker answer because lots of folks can try out the code and find a solution (or multiple solutions), vs. just a few who may be familiar with the specifics</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">Everyone learns...because everyone can run the code and see the problem/solution. This is one of the awesome things about the listserv, it&#39;s a great place to learn new approaches/tricks!</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">In making a REPREX, sometimes we answer our own question. It&#39;s the &quot;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubber_duck_debugging\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubber_duck_debugging&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1E_GfKEHyEmAwvy10yNMLN\">rubber ducky</a>&quot; approach</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">In worksessions, it can mean more time spent helping other folks</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:1.75em;padding-bottom:0.3em;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\">Making a REPREX</h2><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">So how the heck do we make a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minimal_working_example\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minimal_working_example&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lmn3iOgxHJdMTlOYpt_1A\">REPREX</a>?!? It&#39;s a minimum working example, and generally it&#39;s helpful to have the following:</p><ul style=\"padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">required packages/libraries</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">data (can use a small example dataset or just a snippet of your own data)</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\">minimal and clearly commented code (what is each line doing? where does it break or have a problem?)</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">Here are some links to tutorials/options which provide more information:</p><ul style=\"padding-left:2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Reproducibility.html\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Reproducibility.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0H-X8dVjJ9BFb3649a3UzA\">http://adv-r.had.co.nz/Reproducibility.html</a></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"https://www.njtierney.com/post/2017/01/11/magic-reprex/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.njtierney.com/post/2017/01/11/magic-reprex/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24Xt8X9RzEt_7tsDhnr059\">https://www.njtierney.com/post/2017/01/11/magic-reprex/</a></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"https://community.rstudio.com/t/faq-whats-a-reproducible-example-reprex-and-how-do-i-do-one/5219\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://community.rstudio.com/t/faq-whats-a-reproducible-example-reprex-and-how-do-i-do-one/5219&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37EghExR9SRnlevdtcEWGR\">https://community.rstudio.com/t/faq-whats-a-reproducible-example-reprex-and-how-do-i-do-one/5219</a></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"https://www.jessemaegan.com/post/so-you-ve-been-asked-to-make-a-reprex/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.jessemaegan.com/post/so-you-ve-been-asked-to-make-a-reprex/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2G8Y9yLu0x7MiDz9pwR1r4\">https://www.jessemaegan.com/post/so-you-ve-been-asked-to-make-a-reprex/</a></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"https://yihui.name/en/2017/09/the-minimal-reprex-paradox/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yihui.name/en/2017/09/the-minimal-reprex-paradox/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35_P8RoUKH2YPR2zzJUxbe\">https://yihui.name/en/2017/09/the-minimal-reprex-paradox/</a></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/help/minimal-reproducible-example\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/help/minimal-reproducible-example&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0FQe5ObbSGNQzWQvShEnOb\">https://stackoverflow.com/help/minimal-reproducible-example</a></li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><a href=\"https://reprex.tidyverse.org/\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://reprex.tidyverse.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0C6GFssqFHnffzG-MGE4_S\">https://reprex.tidyverse.org/</a></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"></p><h2 style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:1.75em;padding-bottom:0.3em;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Respect_(song)#Aretha_Franklin_version\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Respect_(song)%23Aretha_Franklin_version&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3h4j5mfonMEJ8Zu9TC0_LD\">R.E.S.P.E.C.T.</a></h2><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">Ultimately we want anyone, of any R level (including just beginning!) to feel comfortable asking questions on the D-RUG listserv. Even if that means there is no REPREX. But we also want to respect the time/energy of the folks who kindly respond to questions. So bear that in mind when you are asking, responding, or commenting on the listserv. As always we abide by our <a href=\"https://d-rug.github.io/code-of-conduct.html\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);text-decoration-line:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.github.io/code-of-conduct.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0OfKZj2R6LoxqAGhhMT8jR\">Code of Conduct</a>, and ask our community to do the same.</p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">Thanks much,</p><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">your friendly D-RUG coordinators</p>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><font size=\"1\"><i>&quot;When we try to pick out anything by itself, we find it hitched to everything else in the universe.&quot;<b><br>John Muir (My First Summer in the Sierra, 1911)</b></i></font></div><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>-----------------------------------------------------</b></i></font></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;line-height:19px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div>Ryan Peek, PhD</div><div>Aquatic Ecologist, Post-Doctoral Researcher<br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">Center for Watershed Sciences, UC Davis</div></font></span><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\"><i><a href=\"http://ryanpeek.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ryanpeek.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YLKGKpncrUAZ9ME8hS0VX\">ryanpeek.github.io</a></i></b><br></div><div><b style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">@riverpeek</b></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font