     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nNicely done Sir Peek. Well said. </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nAs soon as I see R.E.S.P.E.C.T. I am bopping to it in my head, pure funk style, so thanks for that - best way to start the week 😉</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nA</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><u><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">                                                                                                          </span></u></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-size:15px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Anna M. Sturrock, PhD</span></b><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Center for Watershed Sciences</span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">University of California, Davis</span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">1 Shields Ave</span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Davis, CA 95616</span></font></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Work: <a href=\"tel:(530)%20754-9133\" value=\"+15307549133\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+1-530-754-9133</a></span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Cell: <a href=\"tel:(510)%20423-2210\" value=\"+15104232210\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+1-510-423-2210</a></span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">Alternative email: </span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\">anna.m....@gmail.com</span></a><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span></div>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"></span>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href=\"http://www.anna-sturrock.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.anna-sturrock.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755629000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2HcwK_V2IA5PVHI-J-uKsv\">http://www.anna-sturrock.com</a></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:15px\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><a href=\"https://watershed.ucdavis.edu/people/anna-sturrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://watershed.ucdavis.edu/people/anna-sturrock&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465755629000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1VXcDIu3DFylvV-sbyAL9E\">https://watershed.ucdavis.edu/people/anna-sturrock</a></span></font></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Ryan Peek &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rap...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, September 23, 2019 6:50 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [D-RUG]: D-RUG Listserv: Guidance for best practices</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div></div></div></div>"
